    <kabod:contentNotes>Per-sermon scripture refs are mapped from the verse-by-verse cadence (37 sermons across Leviticus 1–27); the source page does not annotate individual passages. Sermon #36 is annotated as 'Tithing' (Lev 27); #37 is 'Conclusion'.</kabod:contentNotes>
    <item>
      <title>#1: Introduction to Leviticus</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 21 Aug 1994 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.sermonaudio.com/solo/rbcholland/sermons/11160303059</guid>
      <description>Series on Leviticus #1 This is the introductory sermon to a series on the book of Leviticus.  After listening to this series you will be even more convinced that ALL scripture is inspired by God and profitable....  You will not be disappointed by studying through this blessed portion of scripture.</description>
