    <item>
      <title>#30: The Year of Jubilee: The Ram's Horn!</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 27 Aug 1995 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.sermonaudio.com/solo/rbcholland/sermons/1240322011</guid>
      <description>The Ram's Horn in Leviticus 25 is the inspiration for our logo.  The sermon begins with a dramatic exposition of Leviticus 25.  It shows how the Lord Jesus is the Redeemer foreshadowed in this chapter.  The 30th in an expository series on the book of Leviticus, after you listen to this sermon, you will gain a new appreciation for this Old Testament book and may desire to listen through the entire series.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://cloud.sermonaudio.com/media/audio/high/1240322011.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" length="33848423"/>
      <itunes:duration>1:10:27</itunes:duration>
      <kabod:partNumber>30</kabod:partNumber>
      <kabod:scripture>Leviticus 25</kabod:scripture>
