    <item>
      <title>#36: Tithing</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 19 Nov 1995 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.sermonaudio.com/solo/rbcholland/sermons/119031125</guid>
      <description>Series on Leviticus #36 In a consecutive exposition of the book of Leviticus, Pastor Chanski arrives at a passage which deals with the subject of tithing.  What did this requirement mean to the Israelites in the Old Testament and is it still applicable to new testament saints?  This is an excellent treatment of the subject which draws on passages throughout the scriptures.</description>
      <enclosure url="https://cloud.sermonaudio.com/media/audio/high/119031125.mp3" type="audio/mpeg" length="32443244"/>
      <itunes:duration>1:07:31</itunes:duration>
      <kabod:partNumber>36</kabod:partNumber>
      <kabod:scripture>Leviticus 27</kabod:scripture>
      <kabod:scriptureRef book="Leviticus" startCh="27" startV="1" endCh="27" endV="34"/>
    </item>
